  'RuntimeClientError redacts structured data recursively by exact secret-key names. RuntimeRpcFailureError copies response/error and replaces data only if originally present. Primitive data stays unchanged; any repeated object reference, including noncyclic alias, becomes [circular] after first encounter because a shared WeakSet is not popped.',
