  'Issue text uses state unknown, assignee unassigned, project none and estimate none nullish fallbacks. Priority1/2/3/4 maps urgent/high/medium/low, everything else none. Nonempty label array emits Labels even if Boolean filtering removes every name; truthy due date emits Due. Present comments/children/attachments/relations/activity section metadata emits returned counts; nonempty inlineMedia emits count plus JSON hint.',
  'Search/issue/MCP rows pad identifier10/state14/assignee18, without truncating long text. Explicit truncated false overrides meta.limitReached/search or meta.hasMore/list because ?? is used; truthy truncation adds marker through shared helper. Team key width10; member/state/label name24; state type12. Project helper handles team key/name fallback and independent workspace warnings.',
