  'Caller projects supplied automation/run state; formatter does not resolve current owner. List optional authority items form an id map (last duplicate wins); only matching rows get host/owner issues. Rows join with two newline characters, meaning one blank line. Show includes execution host/owner incarnation/orphan issue only when returned, separately from target line.',
  'Schedule formatter recognizes hourly/daily/weekdays/weekly cron presets only with matching unrestricted calendar fields and singleton time fields; other valid cron displays custom. RRULE preset parser admits exact weekdays sequence or one weekday; a syntactically valid multipleday nonpreset RRULE can display Invalid schedule. English day labels combine with locale-dependent Intl hour/minute output. This is presentation atop S2 parsing, not execution timing proof.',
