  'Worker read absent source or terminal source joins tail lines with newline, preserving empty lines. Transcript source formats text, tool call (JSON input or [unserializable input] on stringify throw), tool result error marker, and image URL or omitted marker; each message trims its end. JSON.stringify(undefined) does not throw and interpolates undefined. Empty transcript joins to empty text.',
